<title>INDONESIA: Jaya Property says Q1 net slightly up.</title>
<headline>Jaya Property says Q1 net slightly up.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>				  (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     22.15  vs  22.06</p>
<p>    Revenues				 61.40  vs  50.90</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (in rupiah)	94  vs     94</p>
<p>    Gross profit			   33.91  vs  29.12</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 25.19  vs  24.59</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     26.83  vs  23.91</p>
<p>Note : The results were unaudited. PT Jaya Real Property is a property company.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
